  "steps": [
    "Add oats, water and a pinch of salt to a pot. Heat on medium, stirring occasionally 2 minutes until thick.",
    "Mix pudding powder, cocoa, peanut powder and milk in a glass until combined.",
    "Pour into oats; stir 1 minute until thick.",
    "Transfer to bowl; mix in skyr. Eat warm or refrigerate overnight."
  ],
